==Strategy==
This is a pretty standard [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] stage with Lord Gravey as the main threat, while you take down Youcans and Zang Roos disrupting your flow of units. Also Shy Boy for some reason. Make sure to use the startoff to your advantage by building up your wallet and killing the first Zang Roo for good.

When you hit the base, lure Youcan. Then, use [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]] to destroy his [[Barrier]], then kill him as fast as you can. Helping you here is Shy Boy, whom you can use as a stepping stone for units like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]]. [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] is super helpful here as well, being able to deal huge amounts of damage against the Youcan as well as being Wave Immune. While Lord Gravey is in this stage, he doesn't really do much seeing as he's getting constantly Slowed by Housewife, not to mention Gravey already being an enemy without much pushing power.

